CLI.md §3.15: the "editLayer" key and --edit-layer, different, are a usage error.
-- args --
edit req.json --edit-layer other
-- req.json --
{"editLayer":"staging","ops":[]}
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- want --
[exit 2]
[stdout]
[stderr]
canon: "staging": differs from --edit-layer
